OL,3,GNEWSABristol then and now: A city
OL,4,Ashaped by sea and war
OL,5,
OL,6,FTaken in the 1880s, this photograph of
OL,7,FKing Street shows the Coopers Hall, the
OL,8,FTheatre Royal/Bristol Old Vic and the
OL,9,FSt Nicholas' Almshouses. As Bristolians
OL,10,Fwill tell you, Bristol Old Vic is the
OL,11,Foldest continually-used theatre in the
OL,12,FEnglish-speaking world, and remains at
OL,13,Fthe heart of King Street ` now one of
OL,14,Fthe hubs of the city's nightlife.
